      "name": "Cybernetics",
      "actions": null,
      "traits": [],
      "description": "<p>The cybernetics of a cybernetic zombie can be disabled for 1 hour with a successful Disable device dc=19 check. A zombie's cybernetics are disabled for 1 hour if it takes any electricity damage. A cybernetic zombie with disabled cybernetics is Slowed 1 and can't use reactions (including self-destruct).</p>",
      "collapsed": false
    },
    {
      "name": "Self Destruct",
      "actions": -1,
      "traits": [],
      "description": "<p>A cybernetic zombie must use this reaction unless its cybernetics are disabled</p>\n<p><strong>Trigger</strong> The cybernetic zombie is reduced to 0 Hit Points</p><hr /><p><strong>Effect</strong> The zombie's damaged cybernetics explode, dealing (3d8+2) Electricity Damage damage in a 10-foot radius (Basic DC 19 Reflex Saving Throw save). This ability destroys any technological items on the zombie.</p>",
      "collapsed": false
    }
